  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 802.15 Closure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 802.15 “Closure” means the procedures used to cease the use of a facility, or a portion thereof, in a manner that will minimize future risks of environmental damage, and includes all required post-closure inspection, monitoring, reporting, and maintenance activities.\n\nSource. #10998, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14571, eff 5-15-26, EXPIRES: 5-15-36 (formerly Env-Wq 802.12)",
